{
  "about": "Made-up rows. No Splunk produced these: fake_splunk.py serves them as the results of the clicker searches of fixtures/clicker/clicker_detection.yaml, by the index and the value each search names. Users are under example.com. The last search's row has two users in one field, as a multivalue field comes back.",
  "searches": [
